{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617120/extras/eb8d66634bcbdb64d26356cb03f7962d.avif?t=1756235049\" width=600 height=85 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Xant-Rar, a realm meant for peace and enjoyment, needs external help to restore order due to..slight oversights by its deity, the Mighty Rar. As the \u201cLatest Chosen One\u201d, you are the hero tasked with fixing what the Mighty Rar neglected to address or refine. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617120/extras/bccb69fc941a84700778f448eea17e6e.avif?t=1756235049\" width=600 height=85 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617120/extras/15f500d55b36ce30295ce3ec22db5ee5.poster.avif?t=1756235049\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617120/extras/15f500d55b36ce30295ce3ec22db5ee5.webm?t=1756235049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617120/extras/15f500d55b36ce30295ce3ec22db5ee5.mp4?t=1756235049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Procedural World Generation &amp; Adaptive Narrative</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Xant-Rar is a realm that houses environments that are constantly shifting and a dynamic narrative based on the player\u2019s choices. Players must navigate floating islands and interact with... diverse shall we say, inhabitants to fulfill their heroic role. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617120/extras/258f35a674bdaed3942e1be1e944362c.avif?t=1756235049\" width=600 height=85 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tree-based progression with a dynamic class system</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can choose from 6 different tech trees and a flexible class system that allows customization of abilities to suit various playstyles. Options are available for those who prefer crafting, exploration, trade, or a versatile approach, so any difficulties you may encounter with the inhabitants of Xant-Rar can be chalked up as \u201cskill issues\u201d. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617120/extras/69f55fb34ff0c61307ad26376a19c559.poster.avif?t=1756235049\" width=600 height=84 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617120/extras/69f55fb34ff0c61307ad26376a19c559.webm?t=1756235049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617120/extras/69f55fb34ff0c61307ad26376a19c559.mp4?t=1756235049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617120/extras/d477113a2716f5f90086f16d4030f44d.avif?t=1756235049\" width=600 height=85 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Online Co-op and Base Building</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good Heavens! is intended to played by up to 4 players but players can team up with as many players as they want in cooperative online gameplay to build a base on Xant-Rar and go about fixing Rar\u2019s mishaps.\u00a0<br><br>Players can solve quests, raise cities from rubble quite literally, and show the inhabitants of Xant-Rar how it's done...again. (Sorry).</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1617120?t=1756235049","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617120/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756235049","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617120/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756235049","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617120/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756235049","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2560290,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617120/extras/eb8d66634bcbdb64d26356cb03f7962d.avif?t=1756235049\" width=600 height=85 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Xant-Rar, a realm meant for peace and enjoyment, needs external help to restore order due to..slight oversights by its deity, the Mighty Rar. As the \u201cLatest Chosen One\u201d, you are the hero tasked with fixing what the Mighty Rar neglected to address or refine. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617120/extras/bccb69fc941a84700778f448eea17e6e.avif?t=1756235049\" width=600 height=85 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster