eamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617120/extras/69f55fb34ff0c61307ad26376a19c559.webm?t=1756235049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617120/extras/69f55fb34ff0c61307ad26376a19c559.mp4?t=1756235049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617120/extras/d477113a2716f5f90086f16d4030f44d.avif?t=1756235049\" width=600 height=85 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Online Co-op and Base Building</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good Heavens! is intended to played by up to 4 players but players can team up with as many players as they want in cooperative online gameplay to build a base on Xant-Rar and go about fixing Rar\u2019s mishaps.\u00a0<br><br>Players can solve quests, raise cities from rubble quite literally, and show the inhabitants of Xant-Rar how it's done...again. (Sorry).</p>","developers":["Nowhere Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617120/header.jpg?t=1756235049","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Nowhere Studios - All Rights Reserved,","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1617120/704503/384715a29c5f7a2c7cff81fdc5402e0a0fc9c562/1751010258/dash_av1.mpd?t=1716562970","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.stea